    "detailed_description": "Would you like to live a sweet and funny school life with four good-looking noris?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Story\u3011<br />\r\nThis is a world where &quot;nori&quot; and &quot;rice&quot; exist as a race.<br />\r\nThe union of &quot;nori&quot; and &quot;rice&quot; is called &quot;omusubi&quot; and many people long for a beautiful &quot;omusubi&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main character, Akita Komachi, transfers to a prestigious high school, &quot;Omusubi Gakuen&quot;, in order to meet a wonderful nori as a rice from a good family.<br />\r\nWhat awaited Komachi were four wonderful &quot;good-looking noris&quot; ......!<br />\r\nWhich &quot;nori&quot; will you &quot;omusubi&quot; with ......?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Game Outline\u3011<br />\r\n\u30fbGame genre\uff1aRomance adventure game<br />\r\n\u30fbCharacters to capture\uff1a\uff14 noris<br />\r\n\u30fbCharacter voice\uff1aPartial only<br />\r\n\u30fbRoute Branching\uff1aNone(To be implemented in the full version)<br />\r\nThis game aims to &quot;Omusubi&quot; with &quot;Nori&quot;, the target of the game, while reading the story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was created by graduates of Vantan Game Academy.<br />\r\nDevelopment of the game began while the students were still in school, and now a trial version has been completed with the cooperation of Vantan Game Academy.",
    "about_the_game": "Would you like to live a sweet and funny school life with four good-looking noris?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Story\u3011<br />\r\nThis is a world where &quot;nori&quot; and &quot;rice&quot; exist as a race.<br />\r\nThe union of &quot;nori&quot; and &quot;rice&quot; is called &quot;omusubi&quot; and many people long for a beautiful &quot;omusubi&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main character, Akita Komachi, transfers to a prestigious high school, &quot;Omusubi Gakuen&quot;, in order to meet a wonderful nori as a rice from a good family.<br />\r\nWhat awaited Komachi were four wonderful &quot;good-looking noris&quot; ......!<br />\r\nWhich &quot;nori&quot; will you &quot;omusubi&quot; with ......?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Game Outline\u3011<br />\r\n\u30fbGame genre\uff1aRomance adventure game<br />\r\n\u30fbCharacters to capture\uff1a\uff14 noris<br />\r\n\u30fbCharacter voice\uff1aPartial only<br />\r\n\u30fbRoute Branching\uff1aNone(To be implemented in the full version)<br />\r\nThis game aims to &quot;Omusubi&quot; with &quot;Nori&quot;, the target of the game, while reading the story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was created by graduates of Vantan Game Academy.<br />\r\nDevelopment of the game began while the students were still in school, and now a trial version has been completed with the cooperation of Vantan Game Academy.",
